  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A two-cell strip lifted from the brochure's comparison table. The left cell reads \"PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year)\"; the right reads \"Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount\". It is the row the worked example's answer is drawn from.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-09-24",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Une bande de deux cellules tirée du tableau comparatif de la brochure. La cellule de gauche indique « PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year) » ; celle de droite indique « Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount ». C'est la ligne dont est tirée la réponse de l'exemple.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "fr"
    },
    {
      "text": "Una franja de dos celdas tomada de la tabla comparativa del folleto. La celda izquierda dice \"PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year)\"; la derecha, \"Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount\". Es la fila de la que se extrae la respuesta del ejemplo práctico.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "es"
    },
    {
      "text": "شريط من خليتين مأخوذ من جدول المقارنة في الكتيّب. في الخلية اليسرى: \"PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year)\"، وفي اليمنى: \"Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount\". وهذا هو الصف الذي تُستمد منه إجابة المثال المشروح.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ar"
    },
    {
      "text": "Полоса из двух ячеек, взятая из сравнительной таблицы брошюры. В левой ячейке написано \"PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year)\", в правой — \"Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount\". Именно из этой строки взят ответ в разобранном примере.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ru"
    },
    {
      "text": "从宣传册对比表中截取的两格横条。左格写着 \"PRUShield's deductible amount for claims not under panel providers (Per policy year)\"；右格写着 \"Covers 95% of deductible amount that is above S$2,000, you pay S$2,000 and 5% of the remaining deductible amount\"。示例中的答案正是取自这一行。",
